Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.66,0:00:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在田边乡村俱乐部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.17,0:00:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已订购23台推车
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.33,0:00:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并另订30多台通讯设备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.01,0:00:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后续具体事项还有待交涉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.34,0:00:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这部分报告就到此为止了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:15.84,0:00:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（其他人商谈小声）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:20.68,0:00:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一那个部长?  一诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:26.86,0:00:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  这事就先这样推进
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:31.19,0:00:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一是  一还有要报告的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:35.36,0:00:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时没有什么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.20,0:00:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会就开到这  大家辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.70,0:00:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.87,0:00:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一前辈中午吃啥  一随便啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:49.21,0:00:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉莎  你中午在哪儿吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.38,0:00:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一听你的  一这么说最难办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:57.39,0:01:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不如去那家新开店吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.72,0:01:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开便利店对面的吗  一对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:03.73,0:01:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一走吧  一据说意面不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意面不错啊  想吃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:09.56,0:01:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一量也够足  一可我在减肥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.74,0:01:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一是吗  一不能吃太多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.24,0:01:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一那我先走了  一辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.25,0:01:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一久等  一起回吧  一嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.59,0:01:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长  我们就先回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.42,0:01:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长  我们就先回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.59,0:01:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能麻烦您到时顺带锁下门吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.43,0:01:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一好  一您辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:41.76,0:01:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也辛苦了  那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.43,0:01:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个人一起回去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.10,0:01:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们车站离得近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.11,0:01:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关系真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.11,0:01:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一我们先走了  一辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.98,0:02:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（OL的濡湿连裤袜）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.66,0:02:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐藤建设的订单数量有更改
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.83,0:02:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看资料第三页
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.66,0:02:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在数量改为资料上写的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.00,0:02:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你在唬我吗  一并没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.84,0:03:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认过怎么会出现这种问题呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.84,0:03:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是因为
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.68,0:03:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该不是知而不报吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.52,0:03:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为啥这么简单件事都做不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.19,0:03:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.03,0:03:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是和我有仇还是怎样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.20,0:03:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我负责起一直搞出问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.70,0:03:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.37,0:03:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样  我先去趟总公司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.87,0:03:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这回我可保不住你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.04,0:03:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正式辞退可能还没这么快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.38,0:03:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也可以考虑之后去哪发展了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.05,0:03:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（办公室其他做事声）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.39,0:03:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来  部长这次要完
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.07,0:04:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  估计要被辞退了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.74,0:04:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次也出 了同样的茬 子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让部长总不听人意见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.08,0:04:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次看来真惨了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.58,0:04:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这也不是我们控制的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.25,0:04:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是继续我们手上的事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.26,0:04:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条明明我还挺中意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.27,0:04:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚点我们去喝两杯  一起吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.94,0:04:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以啊  可工作有点没收完
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.28,0:04:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一我搞定了去碰头  一好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.95,0:04:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就常去的那家  你搞定过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.62,0:04:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一那辛苦了  一辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.96,0:05:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不知道有没位子  一希望有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  想喝几杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.98,0:05:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.39,0:06:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这份资料能麻烦你一起录入吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.57,0:06:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.92,0:07:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  诶  部长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.42,0:07:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一一直以来辛苦了  一没事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.44,0:07:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要不还是我自己来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.44,0:07:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你也能陪我喝两杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.78,0:07:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下收完工作就去怎样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.45,0:07:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和上司的交流也很重要哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.12,0:07:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一就我和部长吗  一嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.62,0:07:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是今天我有点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.96,0:07:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有约 了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.96,0:07:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  不过大家都在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.97,0:08:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是就没叫上我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.64,0:08:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意的话也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.49,0:08:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前就想问了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.49,0:08:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你和渡边在交往吗  一还没
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.99,0:08:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一什么还没  一诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.33,0:08:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻就是不错啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.01,0:08:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天工作都搞定了我先回了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.68,0:08:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一我刚给你的呢  一明早弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.35,0:08:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.02,0:08:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思  不听从上司吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你换了连裤袜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.71,0:09:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是更喜欢肉色的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.22,0:09:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一肉色更适合你  一千什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.72,0:09:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请住手  等等  住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家这么幸福  真让人羡慕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你要干什么  一我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.40,0:09:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没这运气  倒霉的老是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.74,0:09:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手不要这样  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.58,0:09:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  你要干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.58,0:09:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就给我老实一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.44,0:10:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我一个人这么狐单
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.77,0:10:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你也和我一起吧  一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.61,0:10:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一一起不幸吧  一住手放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.95,0:10:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.63,0:10:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想弄痛你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.48,0:10:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一乖点来吧  一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.83,0:11:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  安分一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.17,0:11:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.17,0:11:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.35,0:11:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊  你在干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.36,0:11:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一好像有点潮  一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.36,0:11:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一和渡边做过吗  一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.53,0:11:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.87,0:11:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.71,0:11:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.55,0:12:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.55,0:12:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  请住手  住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.89,0:12:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖听话  我不想伤你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:17.23,0:12:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不想痛吧  不想吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.74,0:12:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.42,0:12:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让我看看  一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.42,0:12:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让我好好看看  一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.60,0:12:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.61,0:13:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说让你老实点了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.11,0:13:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是你想我再勒紧点呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.62,0:13:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.97,0:13:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.47,0:13:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你这里湿了哦  一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.98,0:13:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一看  湿了  一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.16,0:13:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是更喜欢这条呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.00,0:14:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真香穿过的满是你的味道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.67,0:14:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  你在干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.18,0:14:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我应得的   给我安分点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.35,0:14:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是想我更生气吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.19,0:14:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气过头我可不知道会做出什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.69,0:14:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我也没什么可失去的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.20,0:14:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖  你就安分一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.04,0:14:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.05,0:14:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一住手  一让你安分点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.55,0:14:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安分点别乱动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.89,0:15:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:21.42,0:15:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都让你安分点了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.45,0:15:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  我不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.29,0:16:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一安分点别动  一不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.79,0:16:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.97,0:16:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.65,0:16:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一乖一点  一不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.33,0:16:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一越来越湿了呢  一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.01,0:16:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  一老实点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.34,0:17:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.68,0:17:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不可以  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.36,0:17:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.20,0:17:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  一听这什么声响
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.04,0:17:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要   一淫荡的声响
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.71,0:17:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.05,0:17:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  请停下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.90,0:17:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一快停下\N一更湿了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.91,0:18:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.41,0:18:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.58,0:18:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停一停  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.09,0:18:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以  求您  停下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.77,0:18:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就老实一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.45,0:18:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再继续了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.45,0:18:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.29,0:18:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让我看看\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.46,0:18:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我比那像伙早尝个鲜吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.47,0:19:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让我舔舔  一我不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.97,0:19:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不要看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.81,0:19:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.31,0:19:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.66,0:19:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.50,0:19:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长  快停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.67,0:19:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:50.02,0:19:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小穴长这样\N一求您放了我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.19,0:20:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一住手\N一真吵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.53,0:20:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.71,0:20:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求您快停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.72,0:20:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一住手\N一屁股出来点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.06,0:20:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要  不可以啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.57,0:20:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一求您不要这样\N一乖乖别动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.91,0:20:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一停下\N一插进去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:59.59,0:21:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一我佔得先机了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.60,0:21:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一我先干上了呢\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.94,0:21:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:21.94,0:21:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身下可是渡边的桌子哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.78,0:21:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一很兴奋吧\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:32.95,0:21:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  快住手\N一真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.29,0:21:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:44.97,0:21:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.81,0:21:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不可以啊\N一真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.65,0:22:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小穴真湿\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:06.15,0:22:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不要再这样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.99,0:22:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.33,0:22:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一真湿  真紧\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.51,0:22:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.85,0:22:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,/一下来\N一不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.69,0:22:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  求您快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:47.19,0:22:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手  求您住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.87,0:22:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  好疼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.04,0:23:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一往哪逃呢\N一快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:02.54,0:23:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  快住手\N一真漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:10.05,0:23:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:19.39,0:23:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.90,0:23:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让你听话点\N一好疼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.74,0:23:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜欢疼吧  那就乖乖别动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:35.74,0:23:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:43.58,0:23:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:53.43,0:23:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  快住手\N一真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:57.60,0:24:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一真是太舒服了\N一不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:02.27,0:24:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你小穴简直太棒\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.11,0:24:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:10.44,0:24:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让我再深点啊\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:21.96,0:24:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:27.13,0:24:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求您快停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:47.15,0:24:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:00.99,0:25:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手机好像响了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:08.84,0:25:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要让他听听你这声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:14.51,0:25:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:17.68,0:25:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的  我就说说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:21.68,0:25:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:56.72,0:26:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:01.22,0:26:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一我继续了\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:07.73,0:26:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要是想我打渡边电话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:14.07,0:26:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是不是  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:21.58,0:26:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:27.91,0:26:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:35.26,0:26:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:42.26,0:26:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  不可以\N一真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:57.11,0:27:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就老实一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:12.29,0:27:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一趴好\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:35.65,0:27:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:43.82,0:27:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一这里水声很响\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:52.33,0:27:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:00.84,0:28:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要这样\N一真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:06.68,0:28:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人欲罢不能啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:11.35,0:28:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快射了  别乱动  真棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:19.86,0:28:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:26.37,0:28:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:30.70,0:28:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了  要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:27.09,0:29:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想说出去我不会拦你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:33.27,0:29:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我也要被炒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:41.44,0:29:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如说最后闹一出正合我意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:48.11,0:29:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给渡边送个重磅炸弹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:00.02,0:31:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杉浦  刚客户那边来电
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:04.52,0:31:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说订单数和交货数完全不符
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:09.53,0:31:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  应该是没错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:17.54,0:31:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是更改前的资料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:23.38,0:31:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的数量应该是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:27.71,0:31:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一你到底在搞什么  一可我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:32.72,0:31:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新数据会议时大家都确认过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:37.72,0:31:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一总之先和客户道歉\N一是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:41.90,0:31:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用你了  渡边你跟我走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:46.57,0:31:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一家也准备下一起去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:51.24,0:31:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计会晚回  公司事拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:15.76,0:32:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一放着我来洗吧\N一好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:19.77,0:32:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:22.60,0:32:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩你和部长  收尾就拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:42.46,0:32:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才你男朋友那态度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:47.13,0:32:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是对待上司该有的态度吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:58.97,0:33:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段时间你一直穿的黑色呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:05.31,0:33:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故意唱反调不穿肉色吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:11.48,0:33:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你没说出和我做了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:21.16,0:33:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一而且\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:25.83,0:33:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渡边那嫁伙知道了会痛苦吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:30.17,0:33:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样我就大叫了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:33.01,0:33:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叫到时候麻烦的可是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:41.51,0:33:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正被公司知道我是无所谓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:44.52,0:33:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一给我穿肉色  一不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:49.86,0:33:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我可是有录音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:55.03,0:33:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如把那个传到网上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:59.87,0:34:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被辞退时就把链接发渡边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:05.20,0:34:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一这种事  一觉得办不到吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:09.04,0:34:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一觉得我做不到吗\N一放手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:21.39,0:34:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一乖乖穿过来\N一不穿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:27.39,0:34:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:46.91,0:34:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最讨厌社长那嘴脸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:52.92,0:34:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直想试试在他桌上做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:58.76,0:35:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就在这里干你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:07.10,0:35:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一真是最棒的一天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:27.95,0:35:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:40.47,0:35:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里干你真让人兴奋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:52.48,0:35:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一真的别这样\N一我真生气了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:57.65,0:36:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一全部告诉他\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:06.66,0:36:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:23.01,0:36:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:35.69,0:36:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:44.03,0:36:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:53.04,0:36:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:00.55,0:37:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:10.39,0:37:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一已经湿了\N一不要看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:19.07,0:37:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:26.07,0:37:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:29.24,0:37:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  你在干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:33.41,0:37:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一这潮湿的连裤袜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:39.42,0:37:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:43.92,0:37:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一真让我兴奋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:53.60,0:38:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这潮湿的两腿间简直太棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:00.44,0:38:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:06.95,0:38:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:16.96,0:38:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:20.29,0:38:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说不可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:31.64,0:38:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:35.81,0:38:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一到这来\N一什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:46.49,0:38:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:51.99,0:38:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:55.33,0:39:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不要舔那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:03.50,0:39:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一你真敏感呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:09.84,0:39:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:36.20,0:39:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:39.71,0:39:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  不要这样  住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:49.05,0:39:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别摸那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:52.89,0:39:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一越来越湿了\N一真的不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:58.22,0:40:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴上说不要这里却这么湿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:03.23,0:40:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不是的\N一看你的腿间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:10.07,0:40:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:16.74,0:40:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不  不行\N一看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:21.75,0:40:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以  等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:24.58,0:40:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一都这么湿了\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:31.09,0:40:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一能听到这 声响吧\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:38.43,0:40:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:47.11,0:40:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:55.78,0:40:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:12.13,0:41:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  慢点  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:15.30,0:41:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一越来越湿了\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:25.14,0:41:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:35.32,0:41:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是我最讨厌的社长的桌子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:42.83,0:41:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我用你那下流的淫液
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:47.50,0:41:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好弄髒它吧
