Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:26.82,1:09:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不行了  要死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:44.01,1:09:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:50.85,1:09:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  不行了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:09.37,1:10:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不要了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:17.04,1:10:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要去了  慢点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:28.89,1:10:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:39.90,1:10:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  要坏掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:57.58,1:11:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:10.76,1:11:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是淫荡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:13.60,1:11:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小穴淫液喷满蠢社长的桌子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:20.27,1:11:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一玩得很欢嘛\N一快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:31.95,1:11:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么都不知道的蠢社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:39.79,1:11:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明我更适合这位子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:44.46,1:11:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一世上真不公平\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:53.47,1:11:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:58.31,1:12:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:07.32,1:12:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  放了我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:14.16,1:12:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:19.50,1:12:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  放过我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:28.17,1:12:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸得真紧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:32.51,1:12:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不够
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:39.18,1:12:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:44.69,1:12:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  不要了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:50.69,1:12:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:03.54,1:13:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  快停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:08.55,1:13:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要去了  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:25.23,1:13:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸得真紧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:35.74,1:13:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:51.26,1:13:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一要去了\N一真受不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:57.59,1:14:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:02.77,1:14:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:04.77,1:14:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一要去\N一我也快射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:02.66,1:15:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:08.67,1:15:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍到不错的照片了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:13.50,1:15:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下就真能威胁你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:32.86,1:15:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一合同内容要改下\N一是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:38.36,1:15:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为之前发注错误吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:44.03,1:15:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过不用改动太多吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:47.70,1:15:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里整理了一点资料
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:52.21,1:15:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计不改会超预算
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:55.55,1:16:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次确实是我们出错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:00.55,1:16:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能妥协了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:03.22,1:16:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对方估计也不能超出那个数
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:06.39,1:16:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一估计是\N一这次
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:09.06,1:16:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也只能改动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:13.73,1:16:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就按这个数字来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:17.40,1:16:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:20.74,1:16:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你辛苦下把所有资料弄齐
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:24.91,1:16:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表格到时候邮件附件
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:29.08,1:16:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具体数字可能还是要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:34.92,1:16:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑一趟去确认下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:38.26,1:16:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道杉浦会不会再出茬
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:41.76,1:16:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就辛苦走一趟帮忙确认
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:47.76,1:16:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一那拜托了\N一是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:50.77,1:16:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能请你送两杯茶去社长室吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:54.94,1:16:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我有点不方便
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:02.61,1:17:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一麻烦倒个茶 \N一好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:47.49,1:17:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:55.67,1:18:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:01.51,1:18:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很敏感呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:06.34,1:18:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一在办公弄这么湿\N一不是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:12.35,1:18:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:16.35,1:18:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前就一直想玩玩看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:24.19,1:18:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一很刺激吧\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:27.86,1:18:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一住手\N一你都这么湿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:32.87,1:18:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手真的不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:40.04,1:18:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求您快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:46.05,1:18:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  快停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:57.06,1:19:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下  不行不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:03.73,1:19:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手  不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:10.74,1:19:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:14.75,1:19:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一等等\N一今天也留下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:18.25,1:19:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:22.75,1:19:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总公司那边发离职通知了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:27.42,1:19:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被炒了  就做到这月底
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:34.93,1:19:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天起我要把带薪假消化掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:39.10,1:19:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以今天就是最后一次了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:45.61,1:19:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就看在最后一次的份上
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:49.61,1:19:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能留下来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:55.62,1:19:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不留下来的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:17.47,1:20:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:24.98,1:20:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里这种很常见吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:30.49,1:20:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我也一直很想尝试
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:35.66,1:20:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  慢点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:43.50,1:20:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要  一白天啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:51.34,1:20:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渡边和那狗屁社长一直在聊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:57.68,1:20:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是为了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:02.52,1:21:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他承接我的工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:11.03,1:21:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说下任部长决定是渡边了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:14.53,1:21:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一诶  一真是个好消息呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:18.70,1:21:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一我知道了啦\N一知道什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:24.71,1:21:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一住手\N一是所谓的下克上
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:30.71,1:21:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我想说什么吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:33.22,1:21:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他女朋友正被我这样玩弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:40.72,1:21:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一想想就兴奋
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:49.23,1:21:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样被我玩弄着身体
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:59.08,1:22:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:03.25,1:22:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把舌头伸出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:07.58,1:22:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一让你伸舌头
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:19.93,1:22:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心我一走就把照片全散出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:25.44,1:22:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖把舌头伸出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:32.94,1:22:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想大家看到你的丑态吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:41.45,1:22:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想舔胸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:47.46,1:22:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想让大家知道吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:53.30,1:22:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会妨碍你和渡边的将来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:01.47,1:23:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我弄着这里  你自己解扣子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:11.82,1:23:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:18.82,1:23:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人不想停手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:23.66,1:23:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己把乳头露出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:51.86,1:23:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在自己和男朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:53.86,1:23:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一同工 作的这间办公室
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:00.53,1:24:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你正被我这种像伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:03.37,1:24:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下流地吮吸乳头呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:24.89,1:24:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一真让人受不了\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:33.23,1:24:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:44.74,1:24:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不要\N一简直太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:51.08,1:24:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  别这样弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:02.43,1:25:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道要做什么才穿的绳裤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:15.94,1:25:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:22.61,1:25:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:32.62,1:25:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会好好玩弄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:44.80,1:25:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:53.81,1:25:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么快就湿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:59.32,1:26:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你下面真容易湿呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:03.99,1:26:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一住手\N一连裤袜都湿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:09.49,1:26:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很湿呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:16.17,1:26:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:19.17,1:26:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一真\N一-住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:25.84,1:26:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  你在干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:31.68,1:26:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:42.03,1:26:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一用用这个吧\N一饶了我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:47.20,1:26:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一腿给我分开\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:06.88,1:27:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不  住手\N一越来越湿了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:13.06,1:27:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:22.07,1:27:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  要去了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:30.74,1:27:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一还不能倒下\N一饶了我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:38.08,1:27:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  慢点  等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:45.76,1:27:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  要去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:52.93,1:27:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:18.12,1:28:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也开始想要了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:29.30,1:28:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  坐下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:36.14,1:28:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一让我闻闻内裤味道\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:49.99,1:28:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一从这里开始\N一住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:55.16,1:28:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:59.50,1:29:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一快住手\N一你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:05.84,1:29:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一只能这样了\N一别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:13.34,1:29:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一谁让你不听话\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:24.02,1:29:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:29.69,1:29:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:36.37,1:29:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:58.55,1:30:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  住手  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:05.56,1:30:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:10.73,1:30:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很湿呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:35.76,1:30:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:41.10,1:30:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:53.11,1:30:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还一副不要的表情
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:56.95,1:31:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里湿透了  都看到小穴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:03.62,1:31:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:05.62,1:31:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在办公室里还能这么湿
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:10.13,1:31:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一果然是变态啊\N一求您住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:26.31,1:31:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:30.65,1:31:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:43.33,1:31:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:50.33,1:31:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:13.69,1:32:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一景致不错\N一不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:22.53,1:32:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一要做什么\N一样子真不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:27.70,1:32:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该够了吧  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:35.38,1:32:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴上说住手倒是自己分开腿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:42.72,1:32:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:04.57,1:33:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:09.58,1:33:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:14.92,1:33:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一慢点\N一小穴都是水
